section
  height: fill
  valign: bottom
  text "A rule element is exactly as tall as its line-width, so a 3pt rule occupies 3pt of vertical flow and a 0.1pt rule occupies 0.25pt. Rule B of DESIGN.md D4 applies to every stroke here: the coordinate is the CENTRE of the stroke, so thickening a rule does not move it."
    font-size: 6.5pt
    color: gray(0.5)
